This project includes third-party packages that are distributed under various open-source licenses. Below is a list of packages and their associated licenses.

Artifacts: io.mosip:nfiq1.0, io.mosip:nfiq2.0 (Java 21, --enable-preview)
Parent:   io.mosip:nfiq -> org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-parent 4.1.1 (dependency/plugin management only)
Policy:   no kernel-bom; MOSIP kernel-core and biometrics-util are pinned in the parent pom.xml
          (their versions are not repeated here). Third-party versions below are the latest GA
          releases, as resolved by `mvn dependency:list` / `help:effective-pom` on 2026-09-28 (Boot BOM overrides in the parent pom.xml).
